WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.540
- It's been such a part of
my life for like six years.

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:05.170
- It just feels like a big
chapter in my life is closin'.

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:06.720
- It's changed so many people's lives.

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:10.003
- Without the show, I probably
wouldn't of ever come out.

00:00:12.687 --> 00:00:14.687
(music)

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:18.203
- Two years ago,

00:00:18.203 --> 00:00:20.620
my friend said, "Oh, why
don't you watch this TV show?

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:21.980
It's called Orange is the New Black."

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.320
And I was like, "Oh, no."

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:24.880
- Some really cool lesbian friends of mine

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:26.700
had an Orange is the New Black party.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:27.533
And I thought, "It's got

00:00:27.533 --> 00:00:28.366
loads of lesbians. That's it, I'm sold."

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:32.400
- I've taken days off work,
so I can sit and binge watch.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.080
- I felt every range of emotion.

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:35.930
- Laugh, cry, love.

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:39.530
- I actually remember shouting
at the TV. - It is hard to
watch some of those scenes.

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:40.630
- I couldn't stop laughing.

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:42.536
I was like at the edge of my seat.

00:00:42.536 --> 00:00:43.946
(music)

00:00:43.946 --> 00:00:45.700
- You see these like characters

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:46.840
and they're so brave.

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:47.757
- There are just so many
strong women on there.

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:50.450
- You just wanna be the same.

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:51.410
- Taystee's my favorite.

00:00:51.410 --> 00:00:52.960
She's just really, really funny.

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:54.139
- I don't even know who to choose.

00:00:54.139 --> 00:00:55.270
- (blows air)

00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:56.400
- Probably Poussey.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:57.960
- Alex, she's my girl.

00:00:57.960 --> 00:01:00.460
- It was interesting to
see the strong black women

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:02.030
similar to me on screen.

00:01:02.030 --> 00:01:04.870
- Nicky, I can relate in that
falling for straight women

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:07.108
is never really a great idea.

00:01:07.108 --> 00:01:08.130
- (laughs)

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:08.963
- The first time I watched it,

00:01:08.963 --> 00:01:10.030
I enjoyed it as a show.

00:01:10.030 --> 00:01:11.614
After, when I realized

00:01:11.614 --> 00:01:12.900
that I am gay,

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:14.430
and then when I came
back to watch it again,

00:01:14.430 --> 00:01:18.030
I actually felt a deeper
connection to the show as a whole.

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:20.680
- I told my family I relate to it.

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.960
And then I think that made
my family sort of realize,

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:26.410
like, "Yeah, she's obviously gay."

00:01:26.410 --> 00:01:28.410
(music)

00:01:29.570 --> 00:01:30.920
- This show is a vehicle for

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:33.600
a really strong political message.

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:35.850
- To see same sex relationships on screen

00:01:35.850 --> 00:01:37.960
definitely like opens up a conversation.

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:40.050
- Usually, minorities in TV,

00:01:40.050 --> 00:01:41.970
they just seen us just one dimensional.

00:01:41.970 --> 00:01:43.580
- If we feel a little bit discomforted

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:44.740
I think that's the point.

00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:46.320
- It showed mental health in a

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:47.700
completely different way.

00:01:47.700 --> 00:01:48.740
- That should be normal.

00:01:48.740 --> 00:01:50.400
Until that is the situation

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:52.443
progress will need to be made still.

00:01:53.463 --> 00:01:55.500
(Orange is the New Black melody)

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:56.480
- I will be remembering this

00:01:56.480 --> 00:01:57.730
for a long, long time.

00:01:57.730 --> 00:02:00.031
- The show has defiantly
changed my perceptions.

00:02:00.031 --> 00:02:01.920
- It makes me feel like I'm not on my own.

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:04.670
- It's one of the most pioneering shows

00:02:04.670 --> 00:02:06.260
for and about women.

00:02:06.260 --> 00:02:07.280
- The final episode,

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:08.740
yeah that's gonna be hard I think.

00:02:08.740 --> 00:02:10.720
- It has made such a big mark in my life.

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:12.250
It's gonna be hard to let go.

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:14.270
- It's gonna leave such an impact.

00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:15.240
Although it's sad,

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:16.630
it just means I can
start from the beginning

00:02:16.630 --> 00:02:17.853
and watch it all over.

